                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7fd4bef0-2750-31f0-bdbf-a306f8a915a2",
                        "entry_id": "cac401ec-ae07-3627-9085-f8b0169447bb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "автомоб. гибкая пластина, прикрепляемая к оконцовке крыла для задержания вылетающих из-под колеса брызг, песка и камней"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8707319-6caf-4fb4-b358-5ba3fe66bb72",
                                "sense_id": "7fd4bef0-2750-31f0-bdbf-a306f8a915a2",
                                "text": "У поставляемых в Россию машин настроена под плохие дороги подвеска (пружины и амортизаторы), сделаны дополнительные уплотнения дверей, добавлены защита картера и брызговики."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "63d2005d-f3d1-4c46-a664-273abf2f20ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "cac401ec-ae07-3627-9085-f8b0169447bb",
                        "source_sense_id": "7fd4bef0-2750-31f0-bdbf-a306f8a915a2",
                        "target_lang_word": "mudflap",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mudflap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d59d6f9-1b22-36eb-a72b-e2190deb7c39",
                                        "entry_id": "88959d30-bd42-3f0d-bffb-4ebc972fa03f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rectangular flap mounted near the wheel of a motor vehicle (especially a truck) to prevent mud or rocks from being thrown up (by the wheel), either onto the body panels or into the path of vehicles following behind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f31dd980-78bd-470f-bda0-f3a449ab7de2",
                                                "sense_id": "9d59d6f9-1b22-36eb-a72b-e2190deb7c39",
                                                "text": "Yohji Yamamoto showed Alpine knits with cropped black trousers, fresh-looking coats in vanilla-colored wool, and knits and other wool colors embellished with the sort of female pinup images you see on old gas-station calendars or on the mudflaps of an 18-wheeler."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
